{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"q6ovd682gm79nej500y0bv3","title":"Stand News|立場新聞","desc":"","updated":1790640000000,"created":1650505108657,"custom":{},"fname":"sites.standnews","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"f49994170ce3b6b07b759eaa4dedad04","links":[{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"sites.standnews","id":"q6ovd682gm79nej500y0bv3","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"press-freedom","alias":"📰 Press Freedom under Siege","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":10,"offset":10},"end":{"line":2,"column":56,"offset":56},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"press-freedom"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"sites.standnews","id":"q6ovd682gm79nej500y0bv3","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"faces-of-the-crackdown.jimmy-lai","alias":"⚖️ Jimmy Lai","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":59,"offset":59},"end":{"line":2,"column":108,"offset":108},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"faces-of-the-crackdown.jimmy-lai"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"sites.standnews","id":"q6ovd682gm79nej500y0bv3","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"sites.appledaily","alias":"Apple Daily","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":111,"offset":111},"end":{"line":2,"column":143,"offset":143},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"sites.appledaily"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"sites.standnews","id":"q6ovd682gm79nej500y0bv3","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"howto.replay","alias":"howto.replay","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":154,"offset":1166},"end":{"line":24,"column":170,"offset":1182},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"howto.replay"}},{"from":{"fname":"book-censorship","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":133,"offset":133},"end":{"line":2,"column":152,"offset":152},"indent":[]},"value":"sites.standnews","alias":"sites.standnews"},{"from":{"fname":"book-censorship","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":557,"offset":749},"end":{"line":4,"column":587,"offset":779},"indent":[]},"value":"sites.standnews","alias":"Stand News"},{"from":{"fname":"press-freedom","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":795,"offset":4533},"end":{"line":27,"column":825,"offset":4563},"indent":[]},"value":"sites.standnews","alias":"Stand News"},{"from":{"fname":"press-freedom","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":48,"offset":7387},"end":{"line":50,"column":67,"offset":7406},"indent":[]},"value":"sites.standnews","alias":"sites.standnews"},{"from":{"fname":"sites","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":4,"offset":95},"end":{"line":7,"column":23,"offset":114},"indent":[]},"value":"sites.standnews","alias":"sites.standnews"},{"from":{"fname":"faces-of-the-crackdown.jimmy-lai","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":278,"column":3,"offset":23600},"end":{"line":278,"column":22,"offset":23619},"indent":[]},"value":"sites.standnews","alias":"sites.standnews"},{"from":{"fname":"sites.hkja","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":81,"offset":81},"end":{"line":2,"column":111,"offset":111},"indent":[]},"value":"sites.standnews","alias":"Stand News"},{"from":{"fname":"sites.hkja","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":122,"offset":1504},"end":{"line":12,"column":152,"offset":1534},"indent":[]},"value":"sites.standnews","alias":"Stand News"},{"from":{"fname":"sites.hkja","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":87,"offset":2445},"end":{"line":20,"column":117,"offset":2475},"indent":[]},"value":"sites.standnews","alias":"Stand News"}],"anchors":{"urls":{"type":"header","text":"URLs","value":"urls","line":19,"column":0,"depth":2},"archives":{"type":"header","text":"Archives","value":"archives","line":26,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"wx39zljncctue32jn06u29u","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"stand-news立場新聞\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading\" href=\"#stand-news立場新聞\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><use xlink:href=\"#svg-link\"></use></svg></a>Stand News|立場新聞</h1>\n<p>Related: <a href=\"/notes/ebwvkii7n5nl76w21b65gm5\">📰 Press Freedom under Siege</a> | <a href=\"/notes/jl8k2mxp4vy7nrt1qw5b3ez\">⚖️ Jimmy Lai</a> | <a href=\"/notes/lu2l12dvswb0hkg33eojaxb\">Apple Daily</a></p>\n<p>Stand News was a free non-profit online news website based in Hong Kong from 2014 to 2021. Founded in December 2014, it was the successor of House News. It primarily focused on social and political issues in Hong Kong, and generally took a pro-democracy editorial position.</p>\n<p>《立場新聞》是香港一家立場鮮明的民主派網絡媒體，由《主場新聞》團隊於2014年12月重組創立，創辦人包括蔡東豪、鍾沛權與余家輝。該媒體以非營利信託方式管理，強調獨立自主，曾兩度獲評為香港網絡新聞媒體公信力第一，並榮獲多項國際新聞獎項。2021年12月，因涉嫌發布「煽動性文章」，其高層被香港國家安全處拘捕，資產亦遭凍結，並於同日宣布停運。</p>\n<p><img src=\"/assets/frontpage.thestandnews.png\" alt=\"The StandNews Last Frontpage\">\n<em>(Screenshot of The Standnews Front Page before final closure)</em></p>\n<h2 id=\"urls\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading\" href=\"#urls\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><use xlink:href=\"#svg-link\"></use></svg></a>URLs</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.thestandnews.com\">https://www.thestandnews.com</a> (offline)</li>\n<li>Web page collection from Internet Archive:\n<a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/*/https://www.thestandnews.com\">https://web.archive.org/web/*/https://www.thestandnews.com</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://standnews.co.uk/\">http://standnews.co.uk/</a> (British edition)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"archives\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading\" href=\"#archives\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><use xlink:href=\"#svg-link\"></use></svg></a>Archives</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://collection.news/thestandnews\">昔日立場 by Collection.News Project</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://bafybeibxk2iqd4sdf2ey5djddiro3oohlceet5xe7fxxioaspbbi7adwbi.ipfs.dweb.link/fixtures/standnews-05_12_2022.wacz\">.WACZ(via Collection.News)</a>   (<a href=\"/notes/9jou94aipjmxrwmd28tly5u\">Replay the archived files</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/*/http://www.thestandnews.com/\">Internet Archive on The StandNews</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/notes/74owa8sp34nmlvdwk5io11k\">📕 Book Censorship under the NSL</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/notes/ebwvkii7n5nl76w21b65gm5\">📰 Press Freedom under Siege|新聞自由淪陷</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/notes/wx39zljncctue32jn06u29u\">Collections</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/notes/jl8k2mxp4vy7nrt1qw5b3ez\">⚖️ Jimmy Lai|黎智英</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/notes/egsgjuufo34m4r1084rstob\">HKJA|記協</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"pfy4h1nwep9age7eg0u8xe1","title":"SHKO(Save Hong Kong Online)","desc":"","updated":1790640000000,"created":1648525691085,"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"5c25b73a67123ce891a0cbb3f1fea653","links":[{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"root","id":"pfy4h1nwep9age7eg0u8xe1","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"sites.rfa_cantonese","alias":"RFA Cantonese","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":125,"offset":807},"end":{"line":7,"column":162,"offset":844},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"sites.rfa_cantonese"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"root","id":"pfy4h1nwep9age7eg0u8xe1","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"hong-kong-fire-2025","alias":"Hong Kong Fire 2025","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":30,"offset":1119},"end":{"line":11,"column":73,"offset":1162},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"hong-kong-fire-2025"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"root","id":"pfy4h1nwep9age7eg0u8xe1","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"faces-of-the-crackdown.jimmy-lai","alias":"⚖️ Jimmy Lai case","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":256,"offset":1345},"end":{"line":11,"column":3